<holoml version="0.2">
  <head>
    <title>About the sneaker store</title>
    <meta name="description" content="What this store is, what it shows of HoloML 0.2, what it is made of, and where to find HoloML." />
    <meta name="author" content="The HoloML Authors" />
  </head>
  <scene background="#ebe8e3">
    <viewpoint position="0 1.4 1.7" look-at="0 1.3 -0.7" />
    <light type="ambient" intensity="0.8" />
    <light type="directional" position="2 6 4" look-at="0 0 0" intensity="1.4" color="#fffaf2" />
    <model src="models/studio.glb" />
    <model src="models/plant.glb" position="-2.4 0 -1.9" />

    <label position="0 2.2 -0.7" size="0.16" color="#1d6fa5">Sneaker store</label>

    <panel position="-0.62 1.62 -0.7" width="1.1" size="0.042" color="#1f2328" background="#fbfaf7">
      About this store

      The sneaker store is an example of HoloML 0.2, an open markup language for 3D pages. The store, its shoe pages, and this page are written in HoloML: the hall and its light, the shelves that load their shoes as you come near, the stand-ins that show until they do, the places to go to, the colour and size choices, and the buttons that turn a shoe over and add it to the cart. Short scripts keep the cart.

      The shoe's name, its colourways, and their prices are made up. The checkout page asks for nothing and sends nothing.
    </panel>
    <panel position="0.62 1.62 -0.7" width="1.1" size="0.036" color="#1f2328" background="#fbfaf7">
      Made with

      The shoe is "Materials Variants Shoe" © 2021 Shopify, Inc., from the Khronos glTF Sample Assets, under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence (CC BY 4.0). Its own three colours are here as Midnight, Beach, and Street; the other seven are made from its picture, and the mark on its heel and the lettering on its sole are painted out.

      The hall, the shelves, the bench, the counter, the plants, and the chime are made by the site's own script, tools/prepare.mjs.
    </panel>

    <a href="https://github.com/srajpal/holoml/blob/main/SPEC.md">
      <panel position="-0.9 0.78 -0.7" width="0.8" size="0.05" color="#ffffff" background="#1d6fa5">The HoloML specification</panel>
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/srajpal/holoml/tree/main/examples/sneaker-store">
      <panel position="0 0.78 -0.7" width="0.8" size="0.05" color="#ffffff" background="#1d6fa5">This store's source</panel>
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets/tree/main/Models/MaterialsVariantsShoe">
      <panel position="0.9 0.78 -0.7" width="0.8" size="0.05" color="#ffffff" background="#1d6fa5">The shoe's own page</panel>
    </a>
    <a href="index.holoml">
      <panel position="0 0.5 -0.7" width="0.8" size="0.05" color="#ffffff" background="#5b6472">Back to the store</panel>
    </a>
  </scene>
</holoml>
